# An application binds an attribute, which is not void.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧ ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a(x ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-29 ⟧).x ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.169.

F c0 a foo
F c1 x
F c2
Δ c2 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c1 x c2
P c0 a c1
D c3 c0 a
F c4
Δ c4 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-29
A c5 c3 x c4
D c6 c5 x
P c0 foo c6
